    "updated_at": "2023-05-05T00:47:17Z",
    "body": "Yeah, I'm also encountering this issue. Doing the transform \"by hand\" in JS retains double precision all the way through to line drawing, whereas using `.scale()` and friends causes odd glitches at the limits of single-precision FP accuracy.",
