    "updated_at": "2024-04-18T23:57:02Z",
    "body": "While we do occasionally run into f32 precision limitations in Firefox for layout (like extremely long log pages, tens of megabytes+), like @chrishtr says about f32 being enough for [on-screen] games, I think the needs of canvas2d are fairly well-enough served by f32.",
